Z||000081||Monkeyman||05-25-2001||10:31 AM||||I've got pics of my car but I don't plan on sending them to someone who won't give out the URL to the site without a pic.  Kind of selfish, isn't it?  Something must be amiss here.<P>MM||||reg||1
Z||000082||Kerri 98||05-25-2001||11:35 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B>I've got pics of my car but I don't plan on sending them to someone who won't give out the URL to the site without a pic.  Kind of selfish, isn't it?  Something must be amiss here.<P>MM</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>It's your choice Monkey Man. I can tell you that there isn't one person who is on the page who can say that I didn't respond promply in giving the URL to them after receiving their pics. Well maybe Orief but that's one out of 50, I thought I had sent it to him. I make mistakes just like everyone else does.  I do understand your reluctance however, I would be the same if it had not been for the postings I have read here at Pennocks.  Maybe it's because a sort of family lives here, but if I trust these people enough to advise me on my car, I must be able to trust them to see my face. It isn't like I'm dishing out my address and phone number. You have to stop and think, these people on the board, you probably know better than a mechanic you would take your car to.  You trust him, one..seeing your face...two..working on your car and three..you leave with him knowing your address,phone number etc. Hope you reconsider, The page was created with good intentions. Comments from anyone? Kerri   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>P.S. A vote was taken from those on the Fiero/Pic Page and most felt like you do, If we can't see you, why should you see us? That is the reason there is no URL listed here. So, please reconsider and enjoy the page as we are doing  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">Please send in your photos. I promise you will get the URL ASAP.<p>[This message has been edited by Kerri 98 (edited 05-25-2001).]||||reg||9
Z||000083||fyerstarter||05-25-2001||11:55 AM||||I don't see what the problem is. You send in your contribution and then you are able to participate. I sent in my pic and a day later got an email with the address and I get emails from Kerry every once in a while when there is a big update. <P>If the system wasn't like this I gaurantee there wouldn't be 50 cars/owners on the page right now. There would probably be about 12.||||reg||1
