Z||000085||84Bill||05-25-2001||12:36 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Voytek:<BR><B>Absotively posilutely.  I would not want everyone to view other people while hiding their own face.  If you wanna see me, I gotta see you.  It's that simple.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Oheell ya, me to I went through the process wouldnt be fair to let you cheat. Sent mine in and got the Addy in 10 minutes  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> Kinda hurt a little waiting that long and all but it was worth it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><p>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 05-25-2001).]||||reg||14
